@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+issueNumber: MDL-88618
+notes:
+  editor_tiny:
+    - message: >-
+        The bundled TinyMCE Accordion (`accordion`) and List Styles (`advlist`)
+        plugins are now enabled by default. Accordion is available from the
+        Insert menu, and List Styles extends the existing bullet and numbered
+        list toolbar buttons with additional list style options.
+      type: added
+  core:
+    - message: >-
+        The HTML Purifier configuration used by `purify_html()` now allows the
+        `details` and `summary` elements (including the `open` attribute) so
+        that accordion content created in TinyMCE is not stripped on display.
+      type: changed
